        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(msteams): strip internal tool-trace banners from outbound text",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nMicrosoft Teams outbound adapter did not strip internal tool-trace banners\nfrom assistant-visible text before delivery. Users could see internal\nscaffolding like `⚠️ 🛠️ search repos (agent) failed` in Teams messages.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nAdded `sanitizeAssistantVisibleText` (the canonical shared sanitizer) to\n`msteamsChannelOutbound` via the `sanitizeText` hook. This matches the fix\nalready applied to tlon (#103450) and synology-chat (#102925).\n\n## User Impact\n\n**Before:** internal tool-trace banners visible in Teams messages\n**After:** internal scaffolding stripped, only user-visible prose delivered\n\n## Evidence\n\nBranch: `fix/msteams-sanitize-outbound` | Base: `upstream/main`\n\n### Transport-boundary proof (captured HTTP send)\n\n`deliverOutboundPayloads` drives the msteams channel with a send dependency\nthat POSTs to a local HTTP server — capturing the exact text that would\nreach the Bot Framework API:\n\n```\n$ node --import tsx scripts/proof/msteams-sanitize-transport.mts\n\n=== #103692 msteams transport proof ===\n\n── Case 1: prose + tool-trace banner ──\n  Input banner:  ⚠️ 🛠️ `search repos (agent)` failed\n  Sent text:     **Done.**\n\nAll clear.\n  VERDICT: PASS\n\n── Case 2: trace-only → suppressed ──\n  Sent requests: 0 (expected 0)\n  VERDICT: PASS\n\n── Case 3: clean prose passes through ──\n  Sent text: The pipeline has 3 open deals.\n  VERDICT: PASS\n\nOVERALL: ALL PASSED\n\n✅ No tool-trace banners reached the transport layer.\n✅ Trace-only payloads suppressed before HTTP send.\n```\n\n### Regression tests\n\n```\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/msteams/src/outbound-tool-trace-sanitize.test.ts\n\n ✓ sanitizes tool-trace banners before the send boundary\n ✓ suppresses trace-only payloads before the send boundary\n ✓ preserves clean prose through the send boundary\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)  Tests  3 passed (3)\n```\n\n```\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/msteams/src/channel.test.ts\n\n ✓ advertises sanitizeText that strips internal tool-trace banners\n ✓ sanitizeText returns empty string for trace-only replies\n ✓ sanitizeText strips memory tags from outbound text\n ... 16 more ...\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)  Tests  19 passed (19)\n```\n\n### Diff summary\n\n```\nextensions/msteams/src/channel.ts                           | 2 ++\nextensions/msteams/src/channel.test.ts                      | 26 +++++\nextensions/msteams/src/outbound-tool-trace-sanitize.test.ts | 103 ++++++++++++++++\nscripts/proof/msteams-sanitize-transport.mts                | 148 +++++++++++++++++++++++\n```\n\n- [x] I understand what the code does\n- [x] Change is focused and does not mix unrelated concerns\n",
